{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22908","headline":"谢李六郎中寄新蜀茶 · 白居易","name":"谢李六郎中寄新蜀茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故情周匝向交亲，新茗分张及病身。\n红纸一封书後信，绿芽十片火前春。\n汤添勺水煎鱼眼，末下刀圭搅麴尘。\n不寄他人先寄我，应缘我是别茶人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}